                                                "sense_id": "e738d10b-dffc-3f91-b4c0-18a219e57b5c",
                                                "text": "Lucky Lady is in isolation for a couple of weeks, trying to shake a case of contagious ecthyma, or sore mouth, a condition Ms. Coston described as lamb herpes."
